    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d171-a1">

                <pb facs="0290" n="210" xml:id="pg210"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chinese consul-general at San Francisco to Mr.
                        Wu.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Francisco, Cal.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Chinese merchants here have requested me to forward to you the following
                    petition and ask you to transmit same to Senate and House committee, now in
                    session on Chinese exclusion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ho Yow</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consul-General</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
